From 2ded65130b37abffcd4a1dbb5b0d9a123e879ea3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Viswanath Kraleti <viswanath.kraleti@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:33:21 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] linux-firmware: backport qcom Nord GPU firmware

linux-firmware 20261019 does not yet include the Adreno G713/G716 GPU
firmware for the Qualcomm Nord chipset; it was merged into
linux-firmware.git after the 20261019 release tag was cut.

Backport the upstream commit adding these firmwares ahead of the next
linux-firmware release, and add the gen71300/gen71600 GMU/SQE firmware
and Nord zap.mbn packages to the recipe. The firmware patch carries
binary file additions, so switch PATCHTOOL to git for this recipe.

Link: https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git/commit/?id=0bee5f744b964755f446bc2b1afe30b598d97325

Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-sonnet-5
Signed-off-by: Viswanath Kraleti <viswanath.kraleti@oss.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [meta-qcom specific]
---
 ...m-Add-gpu-firmwares-for-Nord-chipset.patch | 4545 +++++++++++++++++
 .../linux-firmware/linux-firmware_20261019.bb |   18 +-
 2 files changed, 4560 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 meta/recipes-kernel/linux-firmware/linux-firmware/0001-qcom-Add-gpu-firmwares-for-Nord-chipset.patch

